The player for the shared soundfont (../gm.sf3): one build of spessasynth for
every tool that plays MIDI, vendored so nothing loads from a CDN at view time.
sync.sh <project> --sound copies this folder to vendor/design/sound/spessasynth/.
spessasynth_lib.min.d.ts is ours: types for the calls the tools make.

spessasynth_lib 4.3.14, spessasynth_core 4.3.22 and stb-vorbis 0.0.6, all by
spessasus, all under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE in this folder).
https://github.com/spessasus/spessasynth_lib

Files:
- spessasynth_lib.min.js: spessasynth_lib's dist/index.js bundled with its
  dependencies into one ES module (esbuild --bundle --format=esm --minify).
- spessasynth_processor.min.js: spessasynth_lib's dist file, unchanged.
- spessasynth_lib.min.d.ts: hand-written types for the part of the API in use.

To rebuild: npm install spessasynth_lib@4.3.14 esbuild in a scratch folder,
then run esbuild as above on node_modules/spessasynth_lib/dist/index.js and
copy dist/spessasynth_processor.min.js.
